{"title": "Status properties/FreezeDuration", "pageid": 35342, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/FreezeDuration", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>FreezeDuration</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. Conditions with this property does not lose duration over time, and usually have other means of being removed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_FreezeDuration\">List of conditions with FreezeDuration</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Ability_Drain:_Charisma\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Charisma_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Charisma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Charisma_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Charisma (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Charisma</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Charisma reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Ability_Drain:_Dexterity\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Dexterity_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Dexterity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Dexterity_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Dexterity (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Dexterity</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Dexterity reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Ability_Drain:_Intelligence\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Intelligence_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Intelligence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Intelligence_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Intelligence (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Intelligence</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Intelligence reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Ability_Drain:_Strength\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Strength_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Strength (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Strength_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Strength (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Strength</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Strength reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Ability_Drain:_Wisdom\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Wisdom_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Wisdom (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Wisdom_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Wisdom (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Wisdom</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Wisdom reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Arcane_Ward\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Ward (Condition)\">Arcane Ward</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Your Arcane Ward blocks damage equal to its charges and then loses 1 charge. Casting <a href=\"/wiki/Abjuration_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Abjuration spells\">Abjuration spells</a> will add charges equal to the level of the spell.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Bhaal's_Boon\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Boon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Boon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Boon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Boon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Boon (Condition)\">Bhaal's Boon</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Bhaal revels in the affected entity's gift for murder, granting it a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> per marked kill.</li>\n<li>1 point of this bonus Armour Class is lost each time the Slayer avoids an attack.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Boon_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Bhaal's Boon (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Bladesong_Damage_Charge\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Damage Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Damage Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Damage Charge (Condition)\">Bladesong Damage Charge</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A charge that will increase how much damage you deal to enemies by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> when using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Climax\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\">Bladesong Climax</a>.</li>\n<li>You can accumulate these charges by casting Level 1 spells or above that are not weapon attacks.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Bladesong_Healing_Charge\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Healing Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Healing Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Healing Charge (Condition)\">Bladesong Healing Charge</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A charge that increases how much you heal yourself and your allies by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> when using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Climax\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\">Bladesong Climax</a>.</li>\n<li>You can accumulate these charges by attacking with weapons.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Frenzied_Strain\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strain_(Condition)\" title=\"Frenzied Strain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Strain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strain_(Condition)\" title=\"Frenzied Strain (Condition)\">Frenzied Strain</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\">Frenzied Strike</a> adds a stack of Frenzied Strain. The barbarian takes a <b>-1</b> penalty on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> for every stack.</li>\n<li>All stacks are removed when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/38px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/50px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</a> ends.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Life_Essence\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity has absorbed a creature's essence. It can use that essence to cast any <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy\" title=\"Necromancy\">Necromancy spell</a> without consuming a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">spell slot</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Myrkul's_Gift\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul%27s_Gift_(Condition)\" title=\"Myrkul's Gift (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Myrkul's Gift\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul%27s_Gift_(Condition)\" title=\"Myrkul's Gift (Condition)\">Myrkul's Gift</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"10 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>. Until it loses these temporary hit points, this creature deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> with weapon attacks and has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Soul_Oath\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Oath_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Oath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Oath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Soul_Oath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Oath_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Oath (Condition)\">Soul Oath</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature has sworn a Soul Oath to protect its dark master. Should that master die, this creature will also succumb to death.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715005347\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3242/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57799/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12482/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 845883/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.632      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   64.632      1 -total\n 46.71%   30.187     13 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 43.04%   27.817     13 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 41.47%   26.801     13 Template:Icon_link\n 39.87%   25.768     13 Template:Icon_text\n 32.08%   20.737     26 Template:Trim\n 16.87%   10.901     13 Template:Ifempty\n  8.52%    5.509     13 Template:Icon\n  7.18%    4.642      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35342-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715005347 and revision id 330632. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}